### GET request to example server
GET http://localhost:8000/hello

### GET encrypted secret
GET http://localhost:8000/secret
Accept: text/plain

### GET Bulgarian Morse puzzle (plain UTF-8 text, not JSON)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/secret-message
Accept: text/plain

### POST encode Bulgarian text
# Supported: А–Я (including Ъ and Ь), digits 0–9, comma, question mark, full stop.
# UTF-8 text/plain is required (otherwise 415); charset parameters are accepted,
# but request bytes are always read as UTF-8.
# One space separates words in plain text; surrounding/repeated spaces are invalid.
# Morse uses one space between letters and ' / ' between words.
# Blank/unsupported text and unknown/malformed Morse return 400 (JSON error).
# API routes are exact; wrong methods return 405 with Allow.
POST http://localhost:8000/api/encode
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Accept: text/plain

Но какво е океанът, ако не съвкупност от капки?

### POST decode Morse to uppercase Bulgarian Cyrillic (case is lost in Morse)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/decode
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Accept: text/plain

-. --- / -.- .- -.- .-- --- / . / --- -.- . .- -. --.-- - --..-- / .- -.- --- / -. . / ... --.-- .-- -.- ..- .--. -. --- ... - / --- - / -.- .- .--. -.- .. ..--..


### GET a hint without revealing the secret
GET http://localhost:8000/api/hint
Accept: text/plain


###  GET all users
GET http://localhost:8000/users
Accept: application/json


###  POST create new user
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Alice Example",
  "age": 30,
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "status": "active"
}

> {% client.global.set("userId", response.body.id); %}


###  PUT reset user template
PUT http://localhost:8000/users
Accept: application/json


###  GET user by ID
# Uses the {{userId}} returned by the POST request above
GET http://localhost:8000/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json


### PUT replace existing user
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "id": "{{userId}}",
  "name": "Updated Alice",
  "age": 31,
  "email": "alice.updated@example.com",
  "status": "active"
}


###  PATCH update part of a user
PATCH http://localhost:8000/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "status": "inactive"
}


###  DELETE user
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/{{userId}}
Accept: application/json
